{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"1362","attributes":{"title":"New Customized Stash Server v0.20.2 for DeoVR","slug":"1362-new-customized-stash-server-v0202-for-deovr","commentCount":7,"participantCount":4,"createdAt":"2023-05-02T20:32:06+00:00","lastPostedAt":"2026-02-20T16:23:12+00:00","lastPostNumber":7,"canReply":false,"canRename":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"isApproved":true,"canTag":false,"isSticky":false,"canSticky":false,"isLocked":false,"canLock":false,"hasPoll":false,"canStartPoll":false,"canEditRecipients":false,"canEditUserRecipients":false,"canEditGroupRecipients":false,"isPrivateDiscussion":false,"subscription":null},"relationships":{"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"996"}},"posts":{"data":[{"type":"posts","id":"3906"},{"type":"posts","id":"4030"},{"type":"posts","id":"4039"},{"type":"posts","id":"16248"},{"type":"posts","id":"16320"},{"type":"posts","id":"16447"},{"type":"posts","id":"16456"}]},"tags":{"data":[{"type":"tags","id":"2"}]},"recipientUsers":{"data":[]},"recipientGroups":{"data":[]}}},"included":[{"type":"users","id":"996","attributes":{"username":"philpw99","displayName":"philpw99","avatarUrl":null,"slug":"philpw99","joinTime":"2021-07-04T04:55:02+00:00","discussionCount":18,"commentCount":426,"canEdit":false,"canEditCredentials":false,"canEditGroups":false,"canDelete":false,"lastSeenAt":"2026-05-07T15:33:51+00:00","canSuspend":false,"blocksPd":false,"canSpamblock":false},"relationships":{"groups":{"data":[]}}},{"type":"users","id":"10786","attributes":{"username":"rotmgman","displayName":"rotmgman","avatarUrl":null,"slug":"rotmgman","joinTime":"2026-01-14T13:17:32+00:00","discussionCount":0,"commentCount":1,"canEdit":false,"canEditCredentials":false,"canEditGroups":false,"canDelete":false,"lastSeenAt":"2026-01-14T13:34:12+00:00","canSuspend":false,"blocksPd":false,"canSpamblock":false},"relationships":{"groups":{"data":[]}}},{"type":"users","id":"958","attributes":{"username":"Psokol","displayName":"Psokol","avatarUrl":null,"slug":"Psokol"}},{"type":"users","id":"2282","attributes":{"username":"mediocrepattern","displayName":"mediocrepattern","avatarUrl":null,"slug":"mediocrepattern","joinTime":"2023-05-31T03:06:15+00:00","discussionCount":0,"commentCount":1,"canEdit":false,"canEditCredentials":false,"canEditGroups":false,"canDelete":false,"lastSeenAt":"2023-05-31T07:54:52+00:00","canSuspend":false,"blocksPd":false,"canSpamblock":false},"relationships":{"groups":{"data":[]}}},{"type":"users","id":"10896","attributes":{"username":"mbze430","displayName":"mbze430","avatarUrl":null,"slug":"mbze430","joinTime":"2026-02-20T00:49:43+00:00","discussionCount":0,"commentCount":1,"canEdit":false,"canEditCredentials":false,"canEditGroups":false,"canDelete":false,"lastSeenAt":"2026-02-20T00:53:09+00:00","canSuspend":false,"blocksPd":false,"canSpamblock":false},"relationships":{"groups":{"data":[]}}},{"type":"posts","id":"3906","attributes":{"number":1,"createdAt":"2023-05-02T20:32:06+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"\u003Cp\u003EIf you ever use Stash to categorize or organize your VR video, you\u0027ll know how useful Stash really is.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/github.com\/stashapp\/stash\u0022 rel=\u0022ugc nofollow\u0022\u003Ehttps:\/\/github.com\/stashapp\/stash\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EThe big problem for Stash is that: the web interface need a plugin to support DeoVR. The plug-in also loses the graphical web interface of Stash, which makes it not so user-friendly like the native Stash.\u003Cbr\u003E\nSo here is my newly modded Stash binary release:\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/github.com\/philpw99\/stash4deovr\/releases\u0022 rel=\u0022ugc nofollow\u0022\u003Ehttps:\/\/github.com\/philpw99\/stash4deovr\/releases\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EIt works exactly like any other Stash, except in each scene you will see an \u0022Ext. Player\u0022 button. Click on that and DeoVR will open that video file through http protocol.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EThis way you can enjoy the best web interface of Stash and can play video natively in DeoVR. It\u0027s like the best of both at the same time. Also you can use Quest 2 or Pico 4 to view and play the videos as well. Best of all, this solution is completely free.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EDoes it sound too good to be true? Damn right it does ! It\u0027s up to you to trust the Stash team and me.\u003C\/p\u003E","renderFailed":false,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"mentionedByCount":1,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canStartPoll":false,"canLike":false,"likesCount":1},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"1362"}},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"996"}},"polls":{"data":[]},"mentionedBy":{"data":[{"type":"posts","id":"16248"}]},"likes":{"data":[{"type":"users","id":"958"}]}}},{"type":"posts","id":"16248","attributes":{"number":4,"createdAt":"2026-01-14T13:20:08+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/forum.deovr.com\/d\/1362-new-customized-stash-server-v0202-for-deovr\/1\u0022 class=\u0022PostMention\u0022 data-id=\u00223906\u0022\u003Ephilpw99\u003C\/a\u003E Hi! Will you ever consider making a stash4deovr release for the newer version of stash? \u003Cbr\u003E\nI\u0027ve been trying to figure out a way to increase movie card size on your release version with custom css, but nothing is working so far. I see that the newer version of stash has added size slider to movie (called groups now) and other tabs, so I was wondering if you\u0027ll be pulling the new stash changes into your custom build.\u003C\/p\u003E","renderFailed":false,"mentionedByCount":1,"editedAt":"2026-01-14T13:23:00+00:00","canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canStartPoll":false,"canLike":false,"likesCount":0},"relationships":{"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"10786"}},"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"1362"}},"editedUser":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"10786"}},"polls":{"data":[]},"mentionedBy":{"data":[{"type":"posts","id":"16320"}]},"likes":{"data":[]}}},{"type":"posts","id":"4030","attributes":{"number":2,"createdAt":"2023-05-31T03:09:25+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"\u003Cp\u003EThe VR interface shows up but I got \u0022unsupported format\u0022, any idea why? I can play the video in 2D with the stream url but not the url from Ext. Player\u003C\/p\u003E","renderFailed":false,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"mentionedByCount":1,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canStartPoll":false,"canLike":false,"likesCount":0},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"1362"}},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"2282"}},"polls":{"data":[]},"mentionedBy":{"data":[{"type":"posts","id":"4039"}]},"likes":{"data":[]}}},{"type":"posts","id":"4039","attributes":{"number":3,"createdAt":"2023-05-31T13:49:17+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/forum.deovr.com\/d\/1362-new-customized-stash-server-v0202-for-deovr\/2\u0022 class=\u0022PostMention\u0022 data-id=\u00224030\u0022\u003Emediocrepattern\u003C\/a\u003E \u003Cbr\u003E\nMaybe you are using Pico 4 ? I am using Quest 2 and most videos plays fine.\u003Cbr\u003E\nUsually you cannot play the video with the stream url, this is the whole reason I had to make the customized Stash.\u003Cbr\u003E\nIf you can play files with stream URL, go for it.\u003C\/p\u003E","renderFailed":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canStartPoll":false,"canLike":false,"likesCount":1},"relationships":{"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"996"}},"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"1362"}},"polls":{"data":[]},"mentionedBy":{"data":[]},"likes":{"data":[{"type":"users","id":"958"}]}}},{"type":"posts","id":"16320","attributes":{"number":5,"createdAt":"2026-01-21T22:59:24+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/forum.deovr.com\/d\/1362-new-customized-stash-server-v0202-for-deovr\/4\u0022 class=\u0022PostMention\u0022 data-id=\u002216248\u0022\u003Erotmgman\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E \n\n\u003Cp\u003EYeah, I thought no one is using that so I stopped updating for a long time.\u003Cbr\u003E\nThere are two problems in updating the Stash4Deovr:\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Col style=\u0022list-style-type:decimal\u0022\u003E\u003Cli\u003EI am not good at Golang and how to automatically generate the executables. For each release I spent quite a long time figuring out how to bypass the errors and get those things compiled.\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EThe app relies on direct link feature, but \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/forum.deovr.com\/d\/10601-direct-video-links-no-longer-opening\u0022 rel=\u0022ugc nofollow\u0022\u003Ethe recent Meta update has broken this feature\u003C\/a\u003E and makes my build pointless.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ol\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cdel\u003EYeah, I will make the new release, but this time I will think about a way to automatically generate a deeplink for each video. It will take some time. We will see.\u003C\/del\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EUpdate: OK, I just tested it. The direct link works again. So it\u0027s much easier for me. I am going to update the special build to 0.30.1\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EDone:\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/github.com\/philpw99\/stash4deovr\/releases\/tag\/v0.30.1-32dev\u0022 rel=\u0022ugc nofollow\u0022\u003Ehttps:\/\/github.com\/philpw99\/stash4deovr\/releases\/tag\/v0.30.1-32dev\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n","renderFailed":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"editedAt":"2026-01-23T16:33:00+00:00","canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canStartPoll":false,"canLike":false,"likesCount":0},"relationships":{"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"996"}},"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"1362"}},"editedUser":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"996"}},"polls":{"data":[]},"mentionedBy":{"data":[]},"likes":{"data":[]}}},{"type":"posts","id":"16447","attributes":{"number":6,"createdAt":"2026-02-20T00:53:09+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"\u003Cp\u003EI just tried your latest 30.1 and DeoVR on my Quest 3 didn\u0027t do anything.  I still get the the same interface as the original Stash.  It also broke filemonitor.\u003C\/p\u003E","renderFailed":false,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"mentionedByCount":1,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canStartPoll":false,"canLike":false,"likesCount":0},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"1362"}},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"10896"}},"polls":{"data":[]},"mentionedBy":{"data":[{"type":"posts","id":"16456"}]},"likes":{"data":[]}}},{"type":"posts","id":"16456","attributes":{"number":7,"createdAt":"2026-02-20T16:23:12+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/forum.deovr.com\/d\/1362-new-customized-stash-server-v0202-for-deovr\/6\u0022 class=\u0022PostMention\u0022 data-id=\u002216447\u0022\u003Embze430\u003C\/a\u003E \u003Cbr\u003E\nI have a Quest 3 as well, and it works fine.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EThe latest edition was submitted for PR in Stash, so I made it a little less obvious to be compatible with the original UI.\u003Cbr\u003E\nTherefore, I put a little switch in the Settings -\u0026gt; Interface -\u0026gt; Scene Player -\u0026gt; Show \u0027Open in External Player\u0027 button.\u003Cbr\u003E\nWhen the setting is on, in scene details you will always see the little \u0022Open in External Player\u0022 button.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EYeah, it\u0027s hard to catch it, but if I had done it the old way, that add the whole \u0022Open in Ext.\u0022 text to it without a setting to switch it off, I would have been a bad contributor.\u003C\/p\u003E \n\n\u003Cp\u003EEven so, I think the chance of my PR being accepted is lower than 10% anyway. Stash is other geniuses proud child, I am in no way to match their prowess. My code is messy to say the least.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003ENow it comes to the strange \u0022broke file monitor\u0022 bug, because my changes includes adding a route, adding a switch in the setting, and making the UI always show a button. How it broke the file monitor, I have no clue. Perhaps it was a developer edition, not a stable one, so the file monitor was broken by someone else\u0027s contribution.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003ERight now I just updated the fork to latest developer edition. Maybe it works again?\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/github.com\/philpw99\/stash4deovr\/releases\u0022 rel=\u0022ugc nofollow\u0022\u003Ehttps:\/\/github.com\/philpw99\/stash4deovr\/releases\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n","renderFailed":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"editedAt":"2026-02-20T16:40:23+00:00","canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canStartPoll":false,"canLike":false,"likesCount":0},"relationships":{"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"996"}},"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"1362"}},"editedUser":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"996"}},"polls":{"data":[]},"mentionedBy":{"data":[]},"likes":{"data":[]}}},{"type":"tags","id":"2","attributes":{"name":"Release","description":"","slug":"release","color":"#339900","backgroundUrl":null,"backgroundMode":null,"icon":null,"discussionCount":66,"position":1,"defaultSort":null,"isChild":false,"isHidden":false,"lastPostedAt":"2026-05-08T13:44:00+00:00","canStartDiscussion":false,"canAddToDiscussion":false}}]}